 "lore": {
  "intro": "The Core. The vault is here.\nThe Congregation briefing calls the cargo the Ark.\nRatio calls it the sample vessel.\nIt was here before the station. The station\ngrew around it, like scar tissue.\n\nRatio is quiet for the first time.",
  "radio": [
   {
    "trigger": "start",
    "text": "Ratio: ...I'll say this once, and then we work. If it offers you an ending \u2014 any ending \u2014 the offer is the weapon. Guard the door. That's all we are now."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "enter_room:4",
    "text": "Ratio: The vault seal answers the watchers' signet. Last door, Commando."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "pickup:void",
    "text": "Ratio: The watch signet. It was waiting in the far coset. It WANTS to be found, Commando. Remember that at the door."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "kills:20",
    "text": "Ratio: The Warden is the door's idea of a guard. Show it a better one."
   },
   {
    "trigger": "exit",
    "text": "Ratio: The vessel's own reading says there is nothing left to save. I reran it. The threshold is pessimism dressed as precision \u2014 there is enough left to try. Believe me or don't: either way, we guard it. It'll stay quiet a thousand years, as long as someone stands here. Lucky for the universe, I know a guy. Sunward, Commando. We'll take the watch together."
   }
  ],
  "terminals": [
   {
    "room": 2,
    "pos": [
     804.4615242270663,
     77.00961894323342
    ],
    "text": "SITE ONE \u2014 FINAL PROTOCOL\n1. Do not bargain with the door.\n2. There is no rule two.\n\nThe vault holds our cargo.\nThe thing beneath the vault holds the door."
   },
   {
    "room": 7,
    "pos": [
     1730.049086604272,
     180.0
    ],
    "text": "[SAMPLE VESSEL \u2014 EXTERNAL DIAGNOSTIC PORT]\nHULL BREACH: +214y INTO TRANSIT\nCRYOSTASIS: FAILED / RESTORED\nPAYLOAD: NO VIABLE MATERIAL.\nMAKE NO EFFORT AT RECOVERY."
   },
   {
    "room": 7,
    "pos": [
     1600.0,
     49.95091339572798
    ],
    "text": "[The door beneath the vault does not\nspeak in words. It rearranges the room\nuntil the room is a sentence.\nThe sentence is an offer.]\n\nGUARD / ACCEPT / KNEEL / BURN\n\n[You think of Ratio. You guard.]"
   },
   {
    "room": 8,
    "pos": [
     1300.0,
     645.0
    ],
    "text": "[TRANSLATION CONFIDENCE 22%]\nthis alcove held the first watcher.\nit stood here four hundred / thousand /\n[number does not translate] years.\nit is permitted to sit."
   },
   {
    "room": 1,
    "pos": [
     444.4615242270663,
     77.00961894323342
    ],
    "text": "MIRIAD PRIME ARCHIVE OFFICE \u2014 NEVER TRANSMITTED\nSite One was not discovered in survey month four.\nSite One has been a line item since before this\noutpost's own founding charter. The charter\nauthorized study of a 'previously catalogued\nanomaly.'\nNobody assigned to the outpost was shown the\nearlier entry. We are not shown it either. Close\nthis file; do not forward the question upward\nagain."
   },
   {
    "room": 4,
    "pos": [
     444.4615242270663,
     437.0096189432334
    ],
    "text": "SCRATCHED, LOW ON THE WALL, EASY TO MISS\ntape measure, one (1), still on its reel, no\ntape drawn out.\nSomeone set it down gently."
   },
   {
    "room": 6,
    "pos": [
     1075.5384757729337,
     282.9903810567666
    ],
    "text": "[TRANSLATION CONFIDENCE 17%]\nthe last watcher set its signet down here,\nat the far post, where the walk ends twice.\nthe vault seal answers the signet, not the\nhand. whoever carries it stands a watch,\nknowing or not."
   }
  ]
 },
